id=kl_sigoff
name=KL SigOff — Kernel Module Signature Off
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=10000
author=bmjubairdadu
description=Boot-time kernel module-signature disable. Dumps boot partition, hexpatches the sig-enforce check in the kernel image (10 known builds + dynamic engine), repacks and flashes back. Unsigned .ko drivers then insmod cleanly. Needs one reboot after patching.
